# Krypton: Windows performance defaults matching Chromium 158's testing trials.
# Why: use the selected rendering, loading, startup and memory defaults without
# a server-provided variations seed. Retain base::Feature/parameter overrides
# for A/B runs and preserve other platforms and existing platform gates.
# SkipInitialForcedScrollbar uses Blink's generated feature; V8Flag defaults
# use gin's existing startup hook before its generic feature override visitor.
# No compiler flags, V8 hot-path implementation, tests or GN args are changed.
# Source: testing/variations/fieldtrial_testing_config.json (158.0.8127.36).

